{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"f867adac-9e2b-422d-9abb-30bf64062345":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"template--14486593044609__f867adac-9e2b-422d-9abb-30bf64062345-167820966345fc81bc-0":{"type":"image","settings":{"top_subheading":"Move Faster, Stronger","title":"Plyometric Equipment","title_size":60,"subheading":"Boost endurance and burn energy with our cardio essentials! From agility tools and battle ropes to plyoboxes and skipping ropes, these tools keep workouts dynamic, challenging, and fun.","link":"","link_text":"","link_2":"","link_text_2":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-left","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cardio.png","parallax_direction":"top","overlay_opacity":52,"focal_point":"80% 100%"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593044609__f867adac-9e2b-422d-9abb-30bf64062345-167820966345fc81bc-0"],"settings":{"section_height":"450px","mobile_height":"500px","parallax":false,"style":"bars","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5}},"rich_text_XkgWB4":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_gdj7hx":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Aerobic Steps"}},"text_tUWVGd":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Take your cardio and strength workouts higher with our aerobic steps. Adjustable, durable, and versatile—perfect for step training, conditioning, and full-body workouts.<\/p>"}},"button_7YfUcW":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/basketballs","link_text":"See all"}}},"block_order":["heading_gdj7hx","text_tUWVGd","button_7YfUcW"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"text_columns_Nyi3gF":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_GehpjG":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFXSTEP-COREFX-Adjustable-Aerobic-Step-800x1000px_babfa41e-1a7e-4bdc-97b1-7243150b0f51.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"COREFX Aerobic Step","text":"<p>Customize your workout with the COREFX Aerobic Step and risers. Durable, stable, and adjustable, it lets you increase intensity for cardio, strength, and full-body training—one step at a time.<\/p>","button_label":"COREFX Aerobic Step Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/corefx-step?variant=40557231997057"}},"text_block_nxNCcQ":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFXRISER-COREFX-Aerobic-Step-Riser-800x1000-1_8258d419-1379-47b3-a563-628651214423.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"COREFX Riser for Aerobic Step","text":"<p>Add intensity to every step! The COREFX Aerobic Step Riser lets you safely increase height and difficulty for cardio and strength workouts with a secure, non-slip, stackable design.<\/p>","button_label":"COREFX Riser for Aerobic Step Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/corefx-step?variant=40557232029825"}},"text_block_GQLkjX":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/YZ15-Mini-Pump-800x1000px.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"Mini Pump","text":"<p>Compact and portable, this pocket-sized pump inflates balls and helmets quickly—perfect for practice, games, or on-the-go use.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/bat-set?variant=40556610945153"}}},"block_order":["text_block_GehpjG","text_block_nxNCcQ","text_block_GQLkjX"],"name":"t:sections.text-columns.presets.text_columns_with_images.name","settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"featured_collection_QygT3y":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.featured_collection.name","settings":{"title":"","home_featured_products":"aerobic-steps","per_row":4,"rows":2,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"background_image_text_MqKyWD":{"type":"background-image-text","name":"t:sections.background-image-text.presets.large_image_with_text_box.name","settings":{"subtitle":"Speed Starts Here","title":"Agility Training","text":"<p>Train faster, sharper, and stronger with agility essentials. From ladders and hurdles to reaction balls, these tools boost speed, coordination, and quick-foot performance for every level.<\/p>","button_label":"See full selection","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/agility-training","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Agility_Training.png","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":450,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"text_and_image_FqDaD6":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFXCBROPE-Covered-Battle-Rope-MikeJR-800x1000-1.jpg","image_width":400,"subtitle":"Waves of Strength","title":"Battle Ropes","text":"<p>Unleash full-body power with our battle ropes. From standard to braided and covered designs, these durable ropes boost strength, endurance, grip, and high-intensity cardio—perfect for every workout.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_columns_CcBBTk":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_z7bg4e":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BROPE-Battle-Rope-product-shot-800x1000-1_26cf848d-f92c-4093-a6b9-6a87bc56d9ec.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"Battle Rope","text":"<p>Get a full-body workout anywhere with the COREFX Battle Rope. Durable and low-impact, it builds strength, endurance, and explosiveness while boosting grip and cardiovascular fitness—perfect for dynamic, high-energy training.<\/p>","button_label":"Battle Rope Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/battle-rope?variant=40557232324737"}},"text_block_8cNwV6":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PBROPE30-COREFX-Braided-Battle-Rope-30ft-800x1000-1.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"Braided Battle Rope","text":"<p>Designed with a durable braided build, this battle rope delivers smooth, even waves for consistent full-body engagement. Built to handle intense sessions while improving grip, strength, and endurance—indoors or out.<\/p>","button_label":"Braided Battle Rope Shop Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/battle-rope?variant=40557232423041"}},"text_block_gdieXd":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFXCBROPE-Covered-Battle-Rope-product-shot-800x1000-1.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"Covered Battle Rope","text":"<p>Built with a commercial-grade nylon cover, this battle rope is made to last through intense training. Enjoy smooth, powerful waves and full-body conditioning without fraying, shredding, or wear—workout after workout.<\/p>","button_label":"Covered Battle Rope Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/covered-battle-rope"}}},"block_order":["text_block_z7bg4e","text_block_8cNwV6","text_block_gdieXd"],"name":"t:sections.text-columns.presets.text_columns_with_images.name","settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"61c19b45-bc92-4b12-a9c1-952bbbf79aa2":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SCP54-Resistance-Parachute-Laura-800x1000-1.jpg","image_width":400,"subtitle":"Play. Slide. Move.","title":"Parachute, Balls and Gliding Discs","text":"<p>Boost coordination, balance, and full-body fitness with our parachutes, exercise balls, and gliding discs. Fun, dynamic, and versatile tools for active play and training.<\/p>","button_label":"See Collection","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/parachute-balls-and-gliding-discs","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"background_image_text_MTeA8F":{"type":"background-image-text","name":"t:sections.background-image-text.presets.large_image_with_text_box.name","settings":{"subtitle":"Jump, Stack, Train","title":"Plyoboxes","text":"<p>Versatile plyoboxes for every workout. Stack, rotate, or adjust heights to boost explosive power, agility, and full-body strength—safely and effectively.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/skipping-ropes","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFXSTCKPLY-COREFX-StackablePlyobox-Img4-640x491px.jpg","focal_point":"center","layout":"right","height":450,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"text_columns_HLFaR9":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_nPaHjz":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2023_StackablePlyobox-Set-800x1000px.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"Foam Stacking Plyobox","text":"<p>Customizable and safe, the COREFX Foam Stacking Plyobox lets you adjust heights for every workout. Perfect for plyometrics, CrossFit, and full-body explosive training while protecting joints.<\/p>","button_label":"Foam Stacking Plyobox Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/foam-stacking-plyobox"}},"text_block_f8NciR":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFXSTCKPLY-COREFX-Stackable-Plyobox-800x1000-1_12993a61-fa43-4c8d-9dbf-e5ce9db9af9e.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"Stackable Foam Plyobox","text":"<p>COREFX Stackable Foam Plyobox. Its stackable, soft-landing design absorbs impact, protecting knees and ankles while powering your jumps, step-ups, and full-body workouts.<\/p>","button_label":"Stackable Foam Plyobox Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/stackable-foam-plyobox"}},"text_block_ViCCMp":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CFX3PLYOFOAM-COREFX-Foam-Plyo-3-800x1000px.jpg","image_width":230,"title":"3-in-1 Plyobox","text":"<p>Versatile, safe, and space-saving, the COREFX 3-in-1 Plyobox lets you adjust heights for every workout. Perfect for plyometric training, CrossFit WODs, step-ups, and full-body conditioning.<\/p>","button_label":"3-in-1 Plyobox Shop Now","b